=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Lacia} in {z:Mhaura} (I-9) to begin quest and obtain a {i:Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning|Mini Fork of Ltn.|1548}.
* You may prepare for the upcoming battle and whenever you are ready, trade {n:Lacia} the tuning fork to be transported to the arena.
* Trade the fork to the {p:Lightning Protocrystal} to enter the fighting arena.
* Defeat {m:Ramuh Prime} to complete quest.

=2 Notes
* Only {p:Carbuncle|Carbuncle (Avatar)} may be used for this battle.
** {p:Siren} can also be used but it seems unintended.
* Use pet food (e.g. {i:Grape Daifuku|Grape Daifuku|6343}) and bring along a few {i:Dawn Mulsum|Dawn Mulsum|5411} and juices if you don't want to use {p:Astral Flow}
* You must face this challenge alone.
* You may buff outside of the fight. Level cap will not dispel them.
* There is a 15 minutes time limit on the arena.
* **{c=red:Warning}** You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from the starting NPC at any point if you desire and repeat the fight, but the NPC will no longer teleport you to the Cloister.
** These were historically prized for their teleportation abilities, but Home Point warps have largely supplanted them.

